    "module_designation": "Ultrasonic water meters with electronic indication device",
    "description": "Ultrasonic water meter type LXCZ (family DN15, DN20, DN25) designed to measure, memorize and display the volume of water passing through the measurement transducers at metering conditions; intended for measurement of clean water volume in residential use. Compact residential ultrasonic water meter with electronic indication device; measurement based on ultrasonic bidirectional transit-time principle, flow measured by double-pulse system with positive and negative pulses depending on flow direction. Can be installed in horizontal and vertical position; not designed to measure reverse flow. Essential parts: brass cylindrical body firmly connected with plastic calculator housing and inner plastic pipe supports; flow sensor with two reflection sheets in the centre of the brass pipe section and two ultrasonic transducers upstream and downstream; calculator with PCB, electronic scrolling 8-digit LCD with indication range 99999.999 m³ and one replaceable lithium battery (Umax 3.6 V, nominal capacity 19 Ah, 10 years lifetime). Non-essential parts/options: filter, internal valve, motor for valve, strainer, remote controller for communication, pressure sensor (optional, with two non-replaceable batteries), wireless communication interfaces (IR, Bluetooth, WM-Bus, LoRa, LoRaWAN, NB-IoT Standard, GPRS, Cat.1, Sigfox) and pre-payment system."
